# Akko environment overrides (example / documentation only).
#
# You do NOT need this file. `bun run dev` works with zero config:
# the Jazz dev values are inlined in the scripts, and model credentials come from pi's
# agent dir (~/.pi/agent/auth.json), configured via pi itself — not from here.
#
# It exists so that IF you want to avoid the inlined script vars, or point at real infra,
# you can copy it to `.env` (git-ignored). A single ROOT `.env` serves both sides:
#   - Bun auto-loads `.env` for the backend (bun run dev:server)
#   - Vite is configured with envDir="../.." (packages/web/vite.config.ts) to read this
#     same root `.env` for the frontend — but only vars prefixed VITE_ reach the browser.
#
#   cp .env.example .env
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

# ── Backend (gateway) ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# All optional; shown with their defaults.
# AKKO_PORT=8787                 # gateway HTTP/WS port
# AKKO_DATA_DIR=~/.akko          # SQLite + workspace storage root
# AKKO_WORKSPACE=wsp_dev         # dev workspace id booted on startup

# ── Auth (doc 16) ─ Better Auth, in-process, passkeys ────────────────────────────────────
# AKKO_WEB_ORIGIN=http://localhost:5173   # browser origin of the web app (WebAuthn RP origin;
#                                         # its hostname is the relying-party id)
# AKKO_AUTH_SECRET=...                     # session/JWT signing secret (>=32 chars). The dev
#                                         # default is a THROWAWAY value — set a real one to deploy.

# ── Jazz projection (doc 14) ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Set ALL of JAZZ_SYNC + JAZZ_APP_ID + JAZZ_BACKEND_SECRET to enable the backend projector.
# The values below are the THROWAWAY dev defaults used by `bun run dev` / `dev:sync`
# against a local in-memory sync server — NOT real secrets. Replace for real deployments.
# JAZZ_SYNC=http://localhost:4200
# JAZZ_APP_ID=e0c77d7c-fc80-5775-8a1d-7f74d66410bf
# JAZZ_BACKEND_SECRET=akko-dev-backend
# JAZZ_ADMIN_SECRET=akko-dev-admin   # optional: when set, backend publishes schema+policies on boot

# ── Frontend (Vite, build-time) ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Must be prefixed VITE_ to reach the browser bundle. Jazz is the only read model, so the
# app needs a reachable sync server (doc 15) — these point it somewhere other than dev.
# VITE_JAZZ_SYNC=http://localhost:4200
# VITE_JAZZ_APP_ID=e0c77d7c-fc80-5775-8a1d-7f74d66410bf
# VITE_JAZZ_DEBUG=1              # verbose Jazz client logging (pairs with AKKO_JAZZ_DEBUG)

# ── Subagents (doc 03) ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Concurrency caps. Hitting one refuses the spawn (with a reason the model can act on)
# rather than queueing — see doc 03. Defaults: 3 per parent, 8 global, depth 1.
# AKKO_SUBAGENT_MAX_PER_PARENT=3
# AKKO_SUBAGENT_MAX_GLOBAL=8
# AKKO_SUBAGENT_MAX_DEPTH=1

# ── Tests ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# AKKO_LIVE=1                    # opt into the gated live pi prompt e2e test
